sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Next.js Client (Login Page)
    participant NextAuth as NextAuth.js (Credentials Provider)
    participant Prisma as Prisma Client
    participant Neon as Neon DB (PostgreSQL)

    Client->>NextAuth: POST /api/auth/callback (email, password)
    NextAuth->>Prisma: prisma.user.findUnique(email)
    Prisma->>Neon: SELECT * FROM User WHERE email = $1
    Neon-->>Prisma: Returns User Record (hash and role)
    Prisma-->>NextAuth: User Object
    
    Note over NextAuth: bcrypt.compare(Password)
    
    alt Password Match
        NextAuth-->>Client: Set Cookie - JWT Session Token
        Client->>Client: Route user to respective dashboard
    else Password Mismatch
        NextAuth-->>Client: Return 401 Unauthorized Error
    end